            <title>3.16.1</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:15:00 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>188</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.16.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Slack answers: a session answering from a Slack thread now knows it can read files in its folder by path, instead of replying that it cannot find a file it could have opened. When the question comes from you, it answers you directly.
- Slack text can no longer imitate the marker Canopy puts on Slack questions.
]]></description>
